\b Usage telemetry.\b0  This version installs the Chromatic Telemetry Windows service. When "Start with Windows" and telemetry are both enabled in Settings, it sends an anonymous heartbeat to the configured Supabase project: the time, PC name, shop name, the name of the program in use, and the heartbeat interval. Game requests typed by customers are sent the same way. No window titles, file paths, Windows usernames, IP or MAC addresses, or hardware IDs are ever sent. Telemetry can be turned off at any time in Settings > Telemetry.\par
